// Whether a plain return clause (ret.id's fix_ret) still needs the rewrite:
// not for its shape, but because the type it names narrows the value it
// hands back (docs/SPEC.md 1) -- the same repair chk_ret_narrow (mid/types/
// check/expr/more/want/ret/narrow.id) reports as an error.
fix_ret_needs(int f, int e) {
  int need = 1;
  if(is_plain(e) == 1 && fix_ret_narrows(f, e) == 0) {
    need = 0;
  }
} return int need;
